 187:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal.c **** /**
 188:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal.c ****   * @brief  This function de-initializes common part of the HAL and stops the source of time base.
